        "t": "text",
        "v": "The command sends the ticked line to the model with its blocking records, its activities and its actual deliveries. An activity is a step of the line's ordering process, and LN lists each one with its status on the line's status screen, where the first Free activity is the next to be carried out. The answer gives five parts in a fixed order, and its last sentence names that next step or says the line is canceled."
      }
